#[SCENE: SIDEWALK]
[#hide_name] Roro: You leave the tunnel system and return to the sidewalk, letter clenched in your paws, enthused to complete the quest the Xiu has given you. 
Determined, you start assembling the RV plane wings Xiu’s father gave you. 
... Alas, determination does not compensate for ability.
# [RV assembly puzzle?]

Roro: Jeez, does this even go here???
Roro: … what is this supposed to do??
Roro: Is this edible? 

# puzzle solved

After a few misplaced bites and lots of confusion, the RV plane was finally assembled and you prepare to take flight up to Pigeon Land.
Roro: Okay, I totally got this. I'm not nervous at all. 
Roro: Why would I be? It's not like I've been stuck on land my entire life. I'm actually THE flying expert!!!
# cue player to walk to glowing square / area to fly up??

You take a deep breath and start running down the sidewalk. With a final push of your backpaws, the plane wings start to glow and your paws start lifting off the ground.
Roro: OH MY GOD, IT WORKED!!!!
=> END

~ skyscraper_start
#[SCENE: NYC APARTMENTS/SKYSCRAPERS]
# make roro sprite spin / sway in dizziness
#neutral pigeon npc expression
Roro: I think I’m going to vomit up my pizza… 
Guide: Coo! Who are you coo!
Your mind works fast to come up with a convincing lie.
Roro: Oh… I am the plumber! The plumber sent for Macaron’s toiletry troubles.
Guide: … 
Roro: …
You start to sweat a bit as this pigeon stares into your soul 
Guide: Coo! Well why didn’t you say so? Macaron has been complaining non-stop about that blasted system, especially since they’ve been grounded!
Roro: Oh, haha yeah! I'll fix it right up, easy peasy.
Guide: Follow me, coo!
Roro: Alright!!
Roro: (Wow, I'm so convincing!)

#[SCENE: WALKING THROUGH THE NPC APARTMENTS/SKYSCRAPERS]
After walking through the Pigeon Lands, you and the tour guide pigeon come to a stop in front of a beautiful nest decked out with newspapers, coins, twigs, feathers, and flowers.
...
Unfortunately, much of the beautiful nest is stuck within a HVAC air duct with a fan spinning overhead, trapping Macaron inside. 
There is a window in the HVAC air duct that allows you to see Macaron, who is ruffling her feathers in anger. 
Guide: Welp, here we are. Good luck with those toiletry issues!

# The pigeon then flies away, leaving you with a very angry Macaron. 

#macaron angry expression

[#angry] Macaron: Huff, who are you? 
[#hide_name] Roro: Before you could answer, the pigeon quickly intercepted.
Macaron: Here to gawk at my suffering? You vermin!
Roro: … Uh no? I’m here to help you.
Macaron: Coo! Well I don’t need your help, I can figure out how to get out on my own. I am MORE than capable of such a simpleton task.
Macaron ruffles their feathers (collar) angrily and gives out another huff. She also takes out a wine glass and takes a sip.
[#hide_name] Roro: Huh, you didn’t know pigeons could drink. 
Roro: Well, I guess I won’t help you.
Macaron: Good! 
# mischievous roro expression
[#mischievous] Roro: And I guess I won’t give you this beautiful, heartfelt, LOVING letter from Xiu.
[#hide_name] Macaron: Macaron suddenly stops drinking from her glass.
Roro: Since you DON'T want help, I’ll just take this letter back to her… and tell her the LOVE OF HER LIFE… didn’t want her letter.
Macaron: NO, I DO, I REALLY WANT HER LETTER. 
Roro: That’s what I thought! Now stop having a cooing fit and tell me how to get you outta here!!!!

# move macaron sprite closer to window "Macaron comes closer to the glass of her HVAC air prison looking flustered after you bring up her lover"

#macaron flustered expression
Macaron: Fine. I will admit defeat and tell you all I know.
The fanciful bird let out a dramatic sigh, then spoke with the ennui of a bird being held hostage for way too long.
Macaron: I need to fly through that vent to claim freedom, yet that infernal fan is stopping me! Find a way to turn it off so I can soar once again.
[#hide_name] Roro: You nodded enthusiastically, the gears spinning in your head.
Roro: Understood! You can count on me, I am a master electrician.
Macaron: Master electrician? How did you receive that title?
Roro: The community college, duh.
#macaron surprised expression 
Macaron: I did not expect you to hold a degree. You are full of surprises, you vermin.
Roro: (What the heck is a degree?)
Roro: … I’m just going to start trying to figure this out. You be quiet!
#macaron angry expression
[#angry] Macaron: Coo!!!!!

#WIRE PUZZLE STARTS HERE

#thinking/pondering roro expression
#start of wire puzzle
[#thinking] Roro: Okay, I got this! Remember, I am now... a master electrician.
Roro: A little bit of this… a little bit of that?
Macaron: Coo! Are you almost done? 
Roro: IN A MINUTE.
Macaron: You're making me doubt your skills, vermin! 
#solves puzzle
#happy roro expression 
[#happy] Roro: Oh! OH YES, I’M AMAZING!
#neutral roro expression 
[#neutral] Roro: I am definitely adding this to my LockedIn.
#end of wire puzzle 

Macaron: About time! I am free.
